Building ATHENA
===============

The complete build instructions are provided in three forms:

- `COMPILE.ath`: if you already have a usable previous version of ATHENA,
  open this document in ATHENA.
- `COMPILE.pdf`: use the pre-rendered PDF if ATHENA is not yet available.
- `COMPILE.tex`: if you cannot view the PDF, compile this file with a LaTeX
  distribution. It is exported by ATHENA from `COMPILE.ath`.

`COMPILE.ath` is the source document for the compilation guide.
